{"author": "raymond91125", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0046323 D-glucose import\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/30861\n\nTo be replaced by GO:0098708 D-glucose import across plasma membrane\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1rgNRF3Y-mTc2WzK8TRrxlF9tHr2WMkNjdkKDTY1vqTI/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\nImpacted groups: \nAgBase\t1     auto transfer\nBHF-UCL\t4 auto transfer\nEcoCyc\t1\nEcoliWiki\t1\nFlyBase\t1     auto transfer\nGeneDB\t2\nMGI\t11     auto transfer\nRGD\t3\nSGD\t6     auto transfer\nUniProt\t4     auto transfer\nZFIN\t5     auto transfer\n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \nNone.\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2025-10-30T16:08:01Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": "Review annotations to GO:0046323 D-glucose import", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-10-31T06:15:25Z"}
